# Ignore everything by default
*

# Let git look inside every folder so it can find what's allowed below
!*/

# What we're publishing right now: reconnect + top-level docs.
# Everything else (local tooling, personal notes, etc.) stays invisible
# to git until we explicitly add a line for it here.
!reconnect/
!reconnect/**

!README.md
!LICENSE
!SAFETY.md
!.gitignore
